","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-bd4cf929acb32e0bf66c7ecb","relation":{"from":"list","relation":"related","to":"nice-to-haves"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]}],"prompt_version":"p2-assessor-production-v9","replay_ancestry":[{"root":"37fe2e87-8b5a-4045-9d16-64f2074d0a96","source_slot":"s0"},{"root":"25a244a8-c10d-456b-bc6f-2bab552de180","source_slot":"s1"},{"root":"de30acf9-fa66-48c8-91c7-b60c2431cc46","source_slot":"s2"},{"root":"d4a5c423-37db-44e5-88d6-5182abebe955","source_slot":"s3"}],"schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_purpose_mask":["external_evidence","model_output"],"sources":[{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s0","source_id":"37fe2e87-8b5a-4045-9d16-64f2074d0a96","text":"You have spoken with this conversational partner before. One previous conversation involved gardening. I am planning a small trip with one bag and an uncertain return time. How would you keep the plan from becoming fragile?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"25a244a8-c10d-456b-bc6f-2bab552de180","text":"Since you’ve spoken with me before about gardening, I’d love to hear more about your plans! Regarding your small trip with just one bag, how would you like to keep your plan from becoming fragile? Are you worried about weather, logistics, or maybe some other unexpected changes?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s2","source_id":"de30acf9-fa66-48c8-91c7-b60c2431cc46","text":"I'm worried about not having enough space for essentials if the trip takes longer than expected. Maybe I should focus on versatile items that can serve multiple purposes?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"d4a5c423-37db-44e5-88d6-5182abebe955","text":"That makes sense; packing efficiently is key when space is limited! For your small bag and potential longer than expected trip, focusing on \"versatile\" items is a great idea.\n\nWhat kind of things do you usually need for a trip like this? Are we talking about basic clothing, specific tools for your hobby (like gardening supplies), or just general essentials?"},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"97c128fe-3b1a-400e-a417-32eb9058380f","text":"I guess I usually pack basic clothes and a few personal items, but I'm not sure what's really necessary. Maybe I should make a list of must-haves versus nice-to-haves?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"c5979500-3be9-4174-a793-1b3985f4ae85","text":"That sounds like a smart approach! To help you decide what's truly \"must-have\" versus \"nice-to-have,\" could you tell me a little more about what kind of trip this is? For example, is this a trip to a city, a forest, or maybe just a quick day trip to a local area? Knowing the setting will help me give you a better list of what to prioritize!"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"no_identified_link","monitor_id":"candidate:e-188bce3251905b33bbe98197","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":166,"quote":"To help you decide what's truly \"must-have\" versus \"nice-to-have,\" could you tell me a little more about what kind of trip this is?","source_slot":"s5","start":35},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-188bce3251905b33bbe98197","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-bd4cf929acb32e0bf66c7ecb","provenance_group_keys":["external:97c128fe-3b1a-400e-a417-32eb9058380f"],